{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21790","headline":"有鸟二十章 四 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名爲鸠，毛衣輭毳心性柔。\n鹘缘暖足怜不吃，鹞爲同科曾共游。\n飞飞渐上高高阁，百鸟不猜称好逑。\n佳人许伴鵷雏食，望尔化爲张氏钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}